{"results":[{"url":"https://www.delawareonline.com/story/news/2019/04/01/coons-addresses-photo-biden-daughter-during-2015-swearing/3333267002/","final_url":"https://www.delawareonline.com/story/news/2019/04/01/coons-addresses-photo-biden-daughter-during-2015-swearing/3333267002/?gnt-cfr=1&gca-cat=p&gca-uir=false&gca-epti=z1151xxe1151xxv000001&gca-ft=145&gca-ds=sophi&gnt-djm=1","title":"Coons addresses infamous photo of Biden, daughter during swearing-in ceremony","description":"“She did not think of it as anything,” Sen. Chris Coons told The Washington Post. “All three of my kids have known Joe their whole lives.”","language":"en","text":"NEWS\n\n# Coons addresses infamous photo of Biden, daughter during swearing-in ceremony\n\nMeredith Newman\n\nThe News Journal\n\nApril 1, 2019Updated April 3, 2019, 11:12 a.m. ET\n\nSen. Chris Coons addressed a 2015 photo this weekend that captured a moment between his daughter and Joe Biden that critics have used as evidence of the former vice president's alleged inappropriate behavior.","author":"Meredith Newman","published_date":"2019-04-01T19:43:57Z","latency_ms":1280.3698100015026,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}